        <mxCell id="lab6text" value="Configures host-side registry settings and validates storage mechanics&#10;against lab04/lab05 resources. Applied via az vm run-command in Lab 8,&#10;not deployed as a declared Terraform resource. See labs/lab-06-fslogix.md." style="text;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#5C3D0D;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="435" width="550" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
